!invai-floor
# Never in an image, even under an allowed directory.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.github
**/.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/seed-output.json
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/coverage
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/nginx.conf
